        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": \"U1 TPS62933 bucks +24V → +5V ... ─► +5V rail • Powers ESP32-C6 DevKit (5V0 pin)\"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "With EN left floating rather than asserted, the regulator may remain disabled; the +5V rail and the circuitry powered from it, including the ESP32 DevKit, may not receive power.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Anomaly detected: U9's enable input is explicitly unconnected, which can prevent the main buck regulator from producing the required +5V rail."
}

